      "message": "This could confuse the kernel clustering algorithm because it looks like a kernel BUG(). Maybe we could print the original multi-line message first and then after that append the kernel panic line with a short panic message instead?\n\nThe additional advantage would be that the logs would be comparable with ones captured prior to this change.",
